2026-08-07T12:48:20.826+07:00 TRACE 25856 --- [ai-study-hub-be] [http-nio-4040-exec-7] m.m.a.RequestResponseBodyMethodProcessor : Writing [ApiResponse(code=200, message=Documents retrieved, data=[DocumentResponse(id=b353e0e7-61c7-49b9-a23e-09be9f03a021, ownerId=86dde887-6725-449e-a7ac-7fd92195720c, folderId=c0d4ac85-9851-4e7d-b2a4-c0e4c92b01ea, subjectId=379881eb-233a-4030-adbd-c4a041f832ca, title=A, description=null, summary=# English Grammar Summary for Medical Students

This guide covers essential grammar rules for reporting speech, expressing agreement, making comparisons, and identifying word forms.

---

### 1. Reported Speech
Used to convey what someone else said.
*   **Key Adjustments:**
    *   **Pronouns:** Adjust to fit the perspective of the reporter.
    *   **Time/Place words:** (e.g., *now* → *then*, *yesterday* → *the day before*).
    *   **Backshift Tense:** If the reporting verb is in the past, shift the reported verb one step back (e.g., Present Simple → Past Simple; Past Simple → Past Perfect).

### 2. Agreement (So / Too / Neither / Either)
Used to show shared opinions or states.

| Type | Structure | Example |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Positive** | So + aux + subject / Subject + aux + too | "I am tired." "So am I" / "I am too." |
| **Negative** | Neither + aux + subject / Subject + aux + either | "I'm not sick." "Neither am I" / "I'm not either." |

---

### 3. Comparison
*   **Comparative:** Used to compare two things.
    *   *Short Adj:* + **-er + than**
    *   *Long Adj:* **more + than**
*   **Superlative:** Used to compare three or more (highest degree).
    *   *Short Adj:* **the + -est**
    *   *Long Adj:* **the most**
*   **Equal Comparison:** **as + adj + as**
*   **Irregular Forms:** 
    *   Good → better → best
    *   Bad → worse → worst
    *   Far → farther/further → farthest/furthest

---

### 4. Word Forms (Suffixes)
Identifying a word's function by its ending:

*   **Noun:** -tion, -sion, -ment, -ness, -ity, -er, -or, -ism
*   **Verb:** -ate, -en, -ify, -ize
*   **Adjective:** -al, -ic, -ive, -ous, -able, -ible
*   **Adverb:** -ly

---

### 5. Quick Practice Reference
*   **Reported Speech:** Ensure you convert tense and time markers correctly (e.g., "I am taking pills" → "He said he was taking pills").
*   **Agreement:** Match the auxiliary verb (be, do, have, can) to the original sentence.
*   **Comparison:** Identify if the sentence requires a comparative (between two) or superlative (among many) structure., status=READY, aiStatus=COMPLETED, mimeType=application/pdf, fileSize=4660, cloudinaryUrl=https://res.cloudinary.com/dpx7mzzv1/image/upload/v1784941735/grammar_medical.pdf, createdAt=2026-07-31T07:44:20.086669, deletedAt=null, rejectReason=null), DocumentResponse(id=d209fd7b-06b9-428d-8cab-ce7048279501, ownerId=84208b7b-5ae6-4520-a624-b90f2fb93364, folderId=1f93766b-4f18-4404-8594-d49d6f9096ac, subjectId=379881eb-233a-4030-adbd-c4a041f832ca, title=englisg, description=null, summary=null, status=COMPLETED, aiStatus=NOT_STARTED, mimeType=application/pdf, fileSize=30626, cloudinaryUrl=https://res.cloudinary.com/dpx7mzzv1/image/upload/v1785461011/english.pdf, createdAt=2026-07-31T08:40:06.368710, deletedAt=null, rejectReason=null), DocumentResponse(id=230f8b5b-38b3-4f4d-be41-d27966e2df79, ownerId=84208b7b-5ae6-4520-a624-b90f2fb93364, folderId=1f93766b-4f18-4404-8594-d49d6f9096ac, subjectId=379881eb-233a-4030-adbd-c4a041f832ca, title=database, description=null, summary=null, status=COMPLETED, aiStatus=NOT_STARTED, mimeType=application/pdf, fileSize=203239, cloudinaryUrl=https://res.cloudinary.com/dpx7mzzv1/image/upload/v1785462023/SANS_Database_Credentials_Standard_April2025.pdf, createdAt=2026-07-31T08:40:22.959429, deletedAt=null, rejectReason=null), DocumentResponse(id=cf5c895f-0d1d-4f2b-ad28-0d2fde0bef00, ownerId=86dde887-6725-449e-a7ac-7fd92195720c, folderId=c0d4ac85-9851-4e7d-b2a4-c0e4c92b01ea, subjectId=379881eb-233a-4030-adbd-c4a041f832ca, title=C, description=null, summary=null, status=COMPLETED, aiStatus=NOT_STARTED, mimeType=application/pdf, fileSize=30626, cloudinaryUrl=https://res.cloudinary.com/dpx7mzzv1/image/upload/v1785461011/english.pdf, createdAt=2026-08-03T18:51:13.569515, deletedAt=null, rejectReason=null), DocumentResponse(id=6b4c9f53-92ab-42d3-9ef2-88c3cf07028f, ownerId=86dde887-6725-449e-a7ac-7fd92195720c, folderId=c0d4ac85-9851